    { key = "K1", text = "[K1] (Nameplates 0.1.0) Fresh install: open the AddOns list. |cffffd100Expect:|r \"XayaUI Nameplates\" is listed and NOT ticked (disabled by default). Tick it, disable Plater, /reload, type |cff88ccff/xui nameplates|r. |cffffd100Expect:|r \"Nameplates: target colour on.\" and no line saying another nameplate addon is loaded." },
