    { key = "K5", text = "[K5] (Nameplates 0.2.0) Out of combat, /xui > QoL > Nameplates > |cffffd100Match my Plater settings|r. |cffffd100Expect:|r chat says how many of Blizzard's nameplate options changed; the page says \"Now: 12 of 12 match\"; enemy plates show health percent and amount, cast target names and highlighted important casts. Press it in combat: |cffffd100Expect:|r \"not in combat\". |cffffd100Put back|r: |cffffd100Expect:|r the options as they were before. (Walkthrough \"Nameplates: match my Plater settings\".)" },
